<title>USA: Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said weather related receipts. 10 inches of snow on the ground, another two inches forecasted. Trade was active. Compared with Monday, slaughter steers were steady in light test.  No heifers on offer.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3, 1115-1375 lbs 61.85-62.85.</p>
</text>
